# Pebble — PWA Chat Interface for Hermes

Quick install and launch for Hermes agents.

## Install & Start

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Launch URL

```bash
API_KEY=$(grep '^API_SERVER_KEY=' ~/.hermes/.env | cut -d'=' -f2)
echo "http://localhost:5173/?hermes=http://localhost:8642&token=$API_KEY"
```

Open that URL in a browser.

## Verify API Server

If the URL doesn't connect, check the API server is running:

```bash
curl http://localhost:8642/health
# Expected: {"status": "ok", "platform": "hermes-agent"}
```

If connection fails, enable the API server:

```bash
echo "API_SERVER_ENABLED=true" >> ~/.hermes/.env
hermes gateway restart
```

